[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Captured</h2>
<i>~[Ithunderfence.E3] <br>
"The true test of a man's courage comes not during victory, but after defeat."<br>
--High Priest Firestorm </i>  

<p>You have slain the three pirates, but then you recieve a distress call from your friend Balsan! He was surprised by an assault of three powerful pirate lords and was defeated! He says he has been put in a crude jail of Arc Spires. Worse yet, the pirates appear to have formed an alliance with the Shadow Reapers. Rescue Balsan and end the foul alliance.


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[ai6priestsaved]
<h2>You have saved Balsan!</h2>
<p>~[Ithunderfence.B2] <br>
Balsan is safe, now destroy those evil pirates!

[ai6priestdead]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>~[Isunarcher.A3] <br>
Balsan is dead! You have failed!!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>You have destroyed the pirates!</h2>
<p>~[Isunaviary.C6] <br>
That will teach those scum never to mess with you or Balsan! Those pirates had it coming!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,FireScen5

[Failed]
<h2>Death!</h2>
<p>
You are defeated! The Pirates and the Reapers are more powerful than ever! Oh noooo...

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]